---
import { promptConversions, promptModels } from '../lib/prompt-convert';

const models = Object.values(promptModels);
---
<section class="glass converter" data-prompt-converter>
  <div class="converter-head">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">PROMPT BRIDGE</p>
      <h2 class="warm">提示词转换</h2>
      <p>在 Anima、NovelAI V4.5 与 NovelAI V5 之间转译权重、嵌套和画师 tag。全部在浏览器本地完成。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="converter-head-actions">
      <button type="button" data-load-sample>载入示例</button>
      <button type="button" data-rules-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="conversion-rules">详情</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="rules-popover glass" id="conversion-rules" data-rules-popover hidden role="dialog" aria-labelledby="conversion-rules-title">
    <div class="rules-popover-head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">TRANSLATION LIST</p>
        <h3 class="warm" id="conversion-rules-title">转译列表</h3>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-rules-close aria-label="关闭转译列表">✕</button>
    </div>
    <p class="rules-popover-note">
      V4.5 与 V5 的权重语法相同，但 V5 对空格、大小写和词序更敏感。画师名在本站按 V4.5 用下划线、V5 用空格处理；V5 专属 tag 转回 V4.5 时会保留并提示。
    </p>
    <div class="rules-grid">
      {promptConversions.map((conversion) => (
        <article class="rule-card">
          <h4>{conversion.label}</h4>
          <p>{conversion.description}</p>
          <ul>
            {conversion.rules.map((rule) => (
              <li>
                <code>{rule.from}</code>
                <span>→</span>
                <code>{rule.to}</code>
                <small>{rule.note}</small>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="converter-grid">
    <label class="pane">
      <span class="pane-head">
        <span>源模型</span>
        <select data-source-select aria-label="源模型">
          {models.map((model) => <option value={model.id} selected={model.id === 'anima'}>{model.label}</option>)}
        </select>
      </span>
      <textarea data-source aria-label="源提示词" spellcheck="false" placeholder="粘贴 Anima 或 NovelAI 提示词…"></textarea>
    </label>

    <div class="converter-actions" aria-label="转换操作">
      <button type="button" class="primary" data-convert>转换</button>
      <button type="button" data-swap>交换</button>
    </div>

    <label class="pane">
      <span class="pane-head">
        <span>目标模型</span>
        <select data-target-select aria-label="目标模型">
          {models.map((model) => <option value={model.id} selected={model.id === 'novelai'}>{model.label}</option>)}
        </select>
      </span>
      <textarea data-output aria-label="转换结果" readonly spellcheck="false" placeholder="转换结果会显示在这里…"></textarea>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="converter-footer">
    <p class="status" data-status aria-live="polite">选择模型后输入提示词，点击转换。</p>
    <div class="footer-actions">
      <button type="button" data-copy>复制结果</button>
      <button type="button" data-clear>清空</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="converter-note">
    数字权重 <code>1.2::tag::</code> 适用于 NovelAI V4 及以上；旧版请使用 <code>{'{tag}'}</code>（×1.05）/ <code>[tag]</code>（÷1.05）规则。
    Anima 官方建议权重数值明显高于 SDXL（示例 <code>(chibi:2)</code>），转换不会自动缩放数字，必要时请手动上调。
    NovelAI → Anima 时 <code>_</code> 转为空格（<code>score_*</code> 除外）；Anima → V4.5 时画师名转下划线，Anima → V5 时画师名保留空格。
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .converter { position: relative; padding: 18px; }
  .converter-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .converter-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
  .converter-head p:not(.kicker) { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7; }
  .converter-head-actions { display: flex; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
  .converter-head button, .footer-actions button, .converter-actions button {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: 999px; background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-muted); padding: 7px 12px; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .converter-head button:hover, .footer-actions button:hover, .converter-actions button:hover { color: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .converter-head [data-rules-toggle][aria-expanded="true"] { color: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .converter-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; align-items: stretch; }
  .pane { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
  .pane-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 10px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .pane-head select { max-width: 52%; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--field-bg); padding: 5px 9px; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-text); }
  textarea { width: 100%; min-height: 260px; resize: vertical; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 12px; background: var(--field-bg); color: var(--color-text); font: 12px/1.75 ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
  textarea::placeholder { color: var(--color-muted); }
  textarea[readonly] { background: var(--field-bg-readonly); }
  .converter-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; }
  .converter-actions .primary { color: #fff; background: var(--color-accent); border-color: var(--color-accent); }
  .converter-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .status { margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .status.warn { color: #b45309; }
  .footer-actions { display: flex; gap: 7px; }
  .converter-note { margin: 12px 0 0; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .converter-note code, .rule-card code { font-size: 10px; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 5px; background: var(--color-accent-soft); color: var(--color-accent); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .rules-popover {
    position: absolute; top: 64px; right: 18px; z-index: 40;
    width: min(760px, calc(100% - 36px)); max-height: min(72vh, 680px); overflow: auto;
    padding: 16px; border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--color-bg);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 94%, white 6%);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 100vmax rgba(20, 16, 18, 0.28), 0 24px 64px -28px rgba(40, 16, 28, 0.6);
  }
  .rules-popover-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .rules-popover-head h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; }
  .rules-popover-head button { flex: none; width: 28px; height: 28px; border: 1px solid var(--color-line); border-radius: 999px; background: transparent; color: var(--color-muted); cursor: pointer; }
  .rules-popover-note { margin: 8px 0 14px; font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .rules-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .rule-card { padding: 12px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--field-bg-readonly); border: 1px solid var(--color-line); min-width: 0; }
  .rule-card h4 { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; }
  .rule-card > p { margin: 5px 0 9px; font-size: 10px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .rule-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .rule-card li { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 5px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .rule-card li > span { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 10px; }
  .rule-card small { flex-basis: 100%; font-size: 9.5px; color: var(--color-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .converter-head { display: grid; }
    .converter-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .converter-actions { flex-direction: row; }
    .converter-actions button { flex: 1; }
    .rules-popover { position: fixed; top: 8vh; right: 14px; left: 14px; width: auto; max-height: 78vh; }
    .rules-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    textarea { min-height: 190px; }
  }
</style>

<script>import '../scripts/prompt-converter';</script>
